he specified size to the server and wait for the ack from the server. The client will repeat this 30 times and keep track of the total amount of time spent on sending all the messages and receiving all the acks. It computes the throughput by: 30 * message_size_in_bytes / total_time_in_seconds and print the throughput value. After that, the client should exit.","topics":[],"score":182665,"global_rank":408524},{"name":"maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","owner":"maringantis","html_url":"https://github.com/maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"TCP socket program with no limit data transfer from client to server.No FILES operations were used.","topics":[],"score":182665,"global_rank":408525},{"name":"mitchthompson/mitchell-thompson-portfolio","owner":"mitchthompson","html_url":"https://github.com/mitchthompson/mitchell-thompson-portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Hack","description":null,"topics":[],"score":182665,"global_rank":408526},{"name":"Boonanak/I2C-Device-Address-Finder","owner":"Boonanak","html_url":"https://github.com/Boonanak/I2C-Device-Address-Finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":182664,"global_rank":408527},{"name":"coopernurse/cmdlog","owner":"coopernurse","html_url":"https://github.com/coopernurse/cmdlog","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Wrapper for exec.Cmd that logs output to S3 / SMTP","topics":[],"score":182659,"global_rank":408532},{"name":"jwhitley/ReactNativeTesting","owner":"jwhitley","html_url":"https://github.com/jwhitley/ReactNativeTesting","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":182657,"global_rank":408540},{"name":"abapat/Simple-Packet-Sniffer","owner":"abapat","html_url":"https://github.com/abapat/Simple-Packet-Sniffer","stars":0,"forks"